(2040557, 281005, 42984, '<td valign="top">The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd using shallow depth of field. I don''t think that quite happened because your DOF is quite long. It''s unclear if the RH biker or the lady is the subject</td>', 'The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd using shallow depth of field. I don''t think that quite happened because your DOF is quite long. It''s unclear if the RH biker or the lady is the subject', '2006-01-16 01:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040572, 280434, 42984, '<td valign="top">Unlike most of the B&amp;W entries, I believe this one works with it.</td>', 'Unlike most of the B&W entries, I believe this one works with it.', '2006-01-16 01:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040581, 281901, 42984, '<td valign="top">Hmmm .. the person you singled out can''t be seen.  Now that''s a creative interpretation, not sure if it does it for me though.</td>', 'Hmmm .. the person you singled out can''t be seen.  Now that''s a creative interpretation, not sure if it does it for me though.', '2006-01-16 01:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040588, 280873, 34763, '<td valign="top">That''s my favorite pose, asleep hold the granddaughter, great shot.</td>', 'That''s my favorite pose, asleep hold the granddaughter, great shot.', '2006-01-16 01:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040593, 281541, 42984, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, just lovely.  The light and exposure levels and burning really give this life. I just don''t feel it meets the challenge well. The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd using shallow depth of field. But damn, I like this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, just lovely.  The light and exposure levels and burning really give this life. I just don''t feel it meets the challenge well. The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd using shallow depth of field. But damn, I like this shot.', '2006-01-16 01:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040598, 281843, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good stuff. Terrific mellowed lighting and nice clean look to it. Meets challenge well. did you sharpen after resizing?</td>', 'Good stuff. Terrific mellowed lighting and nice clean look to it. Meets challenge well. did you sharpen after resizing?', '2006-01-16 01:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040601, 281543, 42984, '<td valign="top">The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd using shallow depth of field.</td>', 'The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd using shallow depth of field.', '2006-01-16 01:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040612, 280625, 34763, '<td valign="top">which chapel are they playing in? Good action shot</td>', 'which chapel are they playing in? Good action shot', '2006-01-16 02:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040646, 281723, 35545, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well, but I would have dodged his face a little, so we could see it better.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well, but I would have dodged his face a little, so we could see it better.', '2006-01-16 02:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040654, 281444, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''d like to be able to see his face a little better.</td>', 'I''d like to be able to see his face a little better.', '2006-01-16 02:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040658, 281183, 35545, '<td valign="top">Not really standing out from a crowd are they?  Also, the picture could stand some more contrast.</td>', 'Not really standing out from a crowd are they?  Also, the picture could stand some more contrast.', '2006-01-16 02:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040666, 280253, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but she really isn''t singled out from the crowd, and it looks as if you went overboard with the blurring tool.</td>', 'Nice picture, but she really isn''t singled out from the crowd, and it looks as if you went overboard with the blurring tool.', '2006-01-16 02:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040671, 281440, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good light, well filled in the faces and balanced.</td>', 'Good light, well filled in the faces and balanced.', '2006-01-16 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040689, 280916, 23458, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of bw here - great expression - particularly if it''s a candid catch rather than something you set up. 9.</td>', 'Fantastic use of bw here - great expression - particularly if it''s a candid catch rather than something you set up. 9.', '2006-01-16 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040699, 280951, 23458, '<td valign="top">My god ! An extremly accomplished photograph you have here. 9.</td>', 'My god ! An extremly accomplished photograph you have here. 9.', '2006-01-16 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040715, 281397, 42984, '<td valign="top">Yup, he''s singled out for sure. Perhaps more from his position relative to the camera. What a great character, nice capture.</td>', 'Yup, he''s singled out for sure. Perhaps more from his position relative to the camera. What a great character, nice capture.', '2006-01-16 02:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040716, 280883, 42984, '<td valign="top">Composition, clarity and standing out all really good. Love the sharpness and exposure values articularly</td>', 'Composition, clarity and standing out all really good. Love the sharpness and exposure values articularly', '2006-01-16 02:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040755, 281725, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.I''m intrigued about what was happening</td>', 'Nicely done.I''m intrigued about what was happening', '2006-01-16 02:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040758, 280610, 42984, '<td valign="top">The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd using shallow depth of field. There''s not a whole lot of shallowness here</td>', 'The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd using shallow depth of field. There''s not a whole lot of shallowness here', '2006-01-16 02:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040773, 281491, 42984, '<td valign="top">Lovely shallow DOF and subject. If you''d had the opportunity, I''d have moved them back so there was wall and not the distracting glass behind. This would have got rid of the glass that is close to the camera and in focus. It also pays to rotate and get the verticals vertical, it can look like you don''t care about your picture.</td>', 'Lovely shallow DOF and subject. If you''d had the opportunity, I''d have moved them back so there was wall and not the distracting glass behind. This would have got rid of the glass that is close to the camera and in focus. It also pays to rotate and get the verticals vertical, it can look like you don''t care about your picture.', '2006-01-16 02:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040775, 281793, 42984, '<td valign="top">The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd</td>', 'The challenge asked for a person to be singled out in a crowd', '2006-01-16 02:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040778, 281734, 23394, '<td valign="top">morning, cole!</td>', 'morning, cole!', '2006-01-16 02:45:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2040779, 280446, 42984, '<td valign="top">Effective. If you''d had someone in the foreground OOF as well sandwiching thenm, it would be doubly powerful.</td>', 'Effective. If you''d had someone in the foreground OOF as well sandwiching thenm, it would be doubly powerful.', '2006-01-16 02:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040782, 281237, 3080, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge very well.   Perfecly actually.  While technically well done, I think the photo lacks a real interest.  Looks like a photo of a girl picking up her cell phone?  The lighting is more on her arm, which leads me right to her arm, and away from her face, which to me is way more interesting than her arm.  I wish there were a bit more light on her face.  So that I wouldn''t be looking at the arm.  The background is nicely blurred, and I like the lights in the bckground.  The thing growing out of the guys head on the left is bothersome, if not down right hilarious.  He looks like a rhino.  lol.  I like the blue tones.  It gives the photo a point of interest, but unfortunately, it doesn''t hold my attention long.  Light on the face, not on the arm, would have changed this dramatically in my opinion.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'This fits the challenge very well.   Perfecly actually.  While technically well done, I think the photo lacks a real interest.  Looks like a photo of a girl picking up her cell phone?  The lighting is more on her arm, which leads me right to her arm, and away from her face, which to me is way more interesting than her arm.  I wish there were a bit more light on her face.  So that I wouldn''t be looking at the arm.  The background is nicely blurred, and I like the lights in the bckground.  The thing growing out of the guys head on the left is bothersome, if not down right hilarious.  He looks like a rhino.  lol.  I like the blue tones.  It gives the photo a point of interest, but unfortunately, it doesn''t hold my attention long.  Light on the face, not on the arm, would have changed this dramatically in my opinion.~Heather~', '2006-01-16 02:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040790, 280462, 43434, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is shallow DOF or motion, and really don''t care ... this is a great capture.</td>', 'Not sure if this is shallow DOF or motion, and really don''t care ... this is a great capture.', '2006-01-16 02:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040794, 281318, 43434, '<td valign="top">I had a hard time figuring out who is singled out in this shot.</td>', 'I had a hard time figuring out who is singled out in this shot.', '2006-01-16 02:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040798, 281990, 43434, '<td valign="top">Even in New Zealand I can''t remember calling a sheep a person.</td>', 'Even in New Zealand I can''t remember calling a sheep a person.', '2006-01-16 02:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040801, 281219, 43434, '<td valign="top">Even in New Zealand I can''t remember calling a sheep a person.</td>', 'Even in New Zealand I can''t remember calling a sheep a person.', '2006-01-16 02:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040812, 280434, 43434, '<td valign="top">This picture is the one of the many that I think really pinged in black and white, well done on that choice.  I would have liked the crop to have the lady more on thirds than she is .. I think this would have helped with the focus being on her and not on the legs so much.</td>', 'This picture is the one of the many that I think really pinged in black and white, well done on that choice.  I would have liked the crop to have the lady more on thirds than she is .. I think this would have helped with the focus being on her and not on the legs so much.', '2006-01-16 02:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040815, 280404, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a great condid portrait, impressive.</td>', 'This is a great condid portrait, impressive.', '2006-01-16 02:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2040816, 281899, 43434, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, interesting picture, I would comment on the lighting but I love night lighting and like this shot.</td>', 'Good DOF, interesting picture, I would comment on the lighting but I love night lighting and like this shot.', '2006-01-16 02:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
