(2040871, 281642, 42984, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and post processing. Even though the crowd''s way in the distance, I think this works well</td>', 'Excellent capture and post processing. Even though the crowd''s way in the distance, I think this works well', '2006-01-16 03:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
