(2044936, 281990, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot...a little soft, it seems, but that could be my monitor (or my eyes).  I would like to see a bit more contrast, though...the tonal range is kinda close.  As far as subject, framing, composition, and the slant, I like it all.</td>', 'Interesting shot...a little soft, it seems, but that could be my monitor (or my eyes).  I would like to see a bit more contrast, though...the tonal range is kinda close.  As far as subject, framing, composition, and the slant, I like it all.', '2006-01-16 19:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
