(2044945, 281618, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot...the border collie''s coloring and your choice of selective de-sat almost makes the dog blend in to the rest of the shot.  I like the deep depth of field and the perspective.</td>', 'Interesting shot...the border collie''s coloring and your choice of selective de-sat almost makes the dog blend in to the rest of the shot.  I like the deep depth of field and the perspective.', '2006-01-16 19:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
