(2045002, 281381, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The colors are muted, and that fits here.  Her expression is intriguing.  The DOF is almost too great, in my eyes.  The person in the bottom right is a bit distracting to me as it is almost indistinguishable.</td>', 'Great capture.  The colors are muted, and that fits here.  Her expression is intriguing.  The DOF is almost too great, in my eyes.  The person in the bottom right is a bit distracting to me as it is almost indistinguishable.', '2006-01-16 19:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045006, 281586, 23053, '<td valign="top">Cool....thanks for the title, otherwise, I''m sure I would have missed what you had done here.</td>', 'Cool....thanks for the title, otherwise, I''m sure I would have missed what you had done here.', '2006-01-16 19:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045014, 281888, 43565, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a portrait to me than singled out of a crowd.</td>', 'This looks more like a portrait to me than singled out of a crowd.', '2006-01-16 19:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045016, 281899, 23053, '<td valign="top">A captivating subject.  I hope you offered...them...a copy.</td>', 'A captivating subject.  I hope you offered...them...a copy.', '2006-01-16 19:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045023, 281565, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the image photographically speaking, but for some reason it makes me feel a bit uncomfortable seeing young girls (obviously underage) in such a grownup-looking pose.  Perhaps I''m reading way too much into it, but perhaps not.  I do like the angle and the urban look.</td>', 'I like the image photographically speaking, but for some reason it makes me feel a bit uncomfortable seeing young girls (obviously underage) in such a grownup-looking pose.  Perhaps I''m reading way too much into it, but perhaps not.  I do like the angle and the urban look.', '2006-01-16 19:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045036, 279671, 36808, '<td valign="top">Lots of things I like about this!  Busy chaos on one side of the street and on the other nothing much.   The Sepia-like tone lends a journalistic aproach.  The fact that no one else but your subject looks at the camera is very dramatic.  I smell a ribbon here.  :)</td>', 'Lots of things I like about this!  Busy chaos on one side of the street and on the other nothing much.   The Sepia-like tone lends a journalistic aproach.  The fact that no one else but your subject looks at the camera is very dramatic.  I smell a ribbon here.  :)', '2006-01-16 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045067, 280916, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot...looks like one of BradP''s shots...I''m not sure why, though.  If it''s not one of his, please forgive me, I meant no harm.<br/> <br/>This is an interesting capture that is obviously captivating enough that I had to stop and ramble on for a bit.  The processing is sharp without being jagged, and balanced well between dark and light. The DOF is just right...not so severe that all out of focus objects end up as hideous blobs of varying tones.</td>', 'Interesting shot...looks like one of BradP''s shots...I''m not sure why, though.  If it''s not one of his, please forgive me, I meant no harm. This is an interesting capture that is obviously captivating enough that I had to stop and ramble on for a bit.  The processing is sharp without being jagged, and balanced well between dark and light. The DOF is just right...not so severe that all out of focus objects end up as hideous blobs of varying tones.', '2006-01-16 20:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045072, 281901, 23053, '<td valign="top">An inventive take on the challenge that is well executed.  Good luck.</td>', 'An inventive take on the challenge that is well executed.  Good luck.', '2006-01-16 20:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045084, 279319, 43565, '<td valign="top">Frank does not seem to be part of a crowd.  I think the glare on his sunglasses is a little distracting.</td>', 'Frank does not seem to be part of a crowd.  I think the glare on his sunglasses is a little distracting.', '2006-01-16 20:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045350, 279671, 11653, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful! His eyes are down right piercing!</td>', 'This is wonderful! His eyes are down right piercing!', '2006-01-16 21:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045354, 281998, 11653, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Great use of tone. Did you consider cropping off the light corner in the bottom left? This was advanced editing so you could have cloned it out too. It just seems a bit distracting to me. Nice work=9</td>', 'Wonderful. Great use of tone. Did you consider cropping off the light corner in the bottom left? This was advanced editing so you could have cloned it out too. It just seems a bit distracting to me. Nice work=9', '2006-01-16 21:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045365, 280547, 11653, '<td valign="top">nice idea and great contrast between subject and others. The blue sweater even gives this more pop against the neutral colors.</td>', 'nice idea and great contrast between subject and others. The blue sweater even gives this more pop against the neutral colors.', '2006-01-16 21:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045369, 281755, 11653, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Wonderful detail and textures. Great light on the face.</td>', 'Lovely. Wonderful detail and textures. Great light on the face.', '2006-01-16 21:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045375, 281237, 11653, '<td valign="top">The lighting is perfect on this. Nice job.</td>', 'The lighting is perfect on this. Nice job.', '2006-01-16 21:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045378, 279769, 11653, '<td valign="top">Well done! Great detail in his face!</td>', 'Well done! Great detail in his face!', '2006-01-16 21:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045388, 281593, 11653, '<td valign="top">Nice work! I wonder what he is thinking.</td>', 'Nice work! I wonder what he is thinking.', '2006-01-16 21:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045389, 280883, 48717, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are perfect and the exposure is on point.  Good job.</td>', 'The colors in this are perfect and the exposure is on point.  Good job.', '2006-01-16 21:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045390, 279654, 11653, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Wonderful detail and light.</td>', 'Great shot. Wonderful detail and light.', '2006-01-16 21:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045392, 279769, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, wish it were a smidge brighter, otherwise the composition, DOF, and contrast are perfect.</td>', 'Nice capture, wish it were a smidge brighter, otherwise the composition, DOF, and contrast are perfect.', '2006-01-16 21:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045394, 280404, 11653, '<td valign="top">love the light on her face</td>', 'love the light on her face', '2006-01-16 21:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045399, 280288, 48717, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I am scared for you.  Nice grain.  I think it adds to the toughness.  Contrast and exposure well done.</td>', 'Great capture.  I am scared for you.  Nice grain.  I think it adds to the toughness.  Contrast and exposure well done.', '2006-01-16 21:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045400, 280434, 11653, '<td valign="top">Good work. I wish you had been able to get more detail on her face.</td>', 'Good work. I wish you had been able to get more detail on her face.', '2006-01-16 21:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045403, 281941, 11653, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-01-16 21:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045404, 280615, 48717, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  I like the color captured as well as the perspective.  The reflection adds a lot of interest to the shot.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  I like the color captured as well as the perspective.  The reflection adds a lot of interest to the shot.', '2006-01-16 21:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045409, 280725, 11653, '<td valign="top">great colors and details, very nice</td>', 'great colors and details, very nice', '2006-01-16 21:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045414, 280689, 48717, '<td valign="top">I like the soft feel, focus and lighting, of this picture.  Works well.</td>', 'I like the soft feel, focus and lighting, of this picture.  Works well.', '2006-01-16 21:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045422, 280777, 11653, '<td valign="top">I love the way the people on the right are all looking toward the yound boy. Great leading lines. Nice contrast in color/focus (darker&amp;softer) on right too.</td>', 'I love the way the people on the right are all looking toward the yound boy. Great leading lines. Nice contrast in color/focus (darker&softer) on right too.', '2006-01-16 21:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045427, 281870, 11653, '<td valign="top">creative idea!</td>', 'creative idea!', '2006-01-16 21:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045428, 281033, 11653, '<td valign="top">great light-nice reflection too</td>', 'great light-nice reflection too', '2006-01-16 21:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045436, 281300, 11653, '<td valign="top">nice use of desat</td>', 'nice use of desat', '2006-01-16 21:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2045440, 281397, 11653, '<td valign="top">lead runner could be a bit more sharp</td>', 'lead runner could be a bit more sharp', '2006-01-16 21:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
