(2046099, 281843, 49916, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Nicely singled out girl !!!.Wish you to have a nice ribbon</td>', 'Great picture. Nicely singled out girl !!!.Wish you to have a nice ribbon', '2006-01-17 00:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046116, 281440, 49916, '<td valign="top">Great Light Effect.Nicely singled out.Best Photograph of the lot.GOOD LUCK!!!.Must win Blue !!!!!!</td>', 'Great Light Effect.Nicely singled out.Best Photograph of the lot.GOOD LUCK!!!.Must win Blue !!!!!!', '2006-01-17 00:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046154, 281990, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like this quirky composition.  and b&amp;w imo was a great choice.  that extra ear popping up is just a bit distracting from the overall effect.</td>', 'i really like this quirky composition.  and b&w imo was a great choice.  that extra ear popping up is just a bit distracting from the overall effect.', '2006-01-17 00:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046178, 281817, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting.  like the idea of leaving her lips red.  i''m not sure about keeping the left third of the image, as it feels distracting to me and your impact.  perhaps feathering your blur selection would have made the outline around the subject a bit cleaner</td>', 'interesting.  like the idea of leaving her lips red.  i''m not sure about keeping the left third of the image, as it feels distracting to me and your impact.  perhaps feathering your blur selection would have made the outline around the subject a bit cleaner', '2006-01-17 00:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046202, 281887, 13688, '<td valign="top">really like how your foreground subject''s eye points to your background subjects and allows the viewer''s eye to easily move around the image.  the blown highlights i believe are actually a plus as they draw the eye as well.  Overall the background subjects don''t really hold my interest though.  Nevertheless, daring submission, good job.</td>', 'really like how your foreground subject''s eye points to your background subjects and allows the viewer''s eye to easily move around the image.  the blown highlights i believe are actually a plus as they draw the eye as well.  Overall the background subjects don''t really hold my interest though.  Nevertheless, daring submission, good job.', '2006-01-17 00:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046216, 281843, 13688, '<td valign="top">foreground focus and lighting are very good.  your background subject''s stare seems much more intense and much more interesting to me,i guess i wish the focus was flipped (though if that''s your daughter in the hat, you might not agree ;) ).  even with that, i still feel the composition could use another element or person as it seems unbalanced at the moment</td>', 'foreground focus and lighting are very good.  your background subject''s stare seems much more intense and much more interesting to me,i guess i wish the focus was flipped (though if that''s your daughter in the hat, you might not agree ;) ).  even with that, i still feel the composition could use another element or person as it seems unbalanced at the moment', '2006-01-17 01:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046231, 280883, 13688, '<td valign="top">great focus and lighting.  IMHO the center composition hurts this image.  it just feels very static to me and when i think of extreme sports i think dynamic.  also the guy standing behind her seems to get in the way of the leading line of her looking off the edge of the page at something of interest.  perhaps it would have helped if his figure wasn''t so defined against the white snow.</td>', 'great focus and lighting.  IMHO the center composition hurts this image.  it just feels very static to me and when i think of extreme sports i think dynamic.  also the guy standing behind her seems to get in the way of the leading line of her looking off the edge of the page at something of interest.  perhaps it would have helped if his figure wasn''t so defined against the white snow.', '2006-01-17 01:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046250, 281015, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting subject.  the border right on his back feels a bit too tight to me.    your contrast choice, though powerful, has lost details which would have improved this image</td>', 'interesting subject.  the border right on his back feels a bit too tight to me.    your contrast choice, though powerful, has lost details which would have improved this image', '2006-01-17 01:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046257, 281953, 13688, '<td valign="top">very expressive capture.  wish the strong orange hat wasn''t such a distraction.  maybe b&amp;w could have reduced the hat''s impact</td>', 'very expressive capture.  wish the strong orange hat wasn''t such a distraction.  maybe b&w could have reduced the hat''s impact', '2006-01-17 01:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046270, 280625, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice capture at the height of the jumpshot.  Those 2 big guys could have helped by being slightly more interested in attempting to play defense.  I wish you had managed to capture more of the hoop as well as the shot loses it''s leading line</td>', 'nice capture at the height of the jumpshot.  Those 2 big guys could have helped by being slightly more interested in attempting to play defense.  I wish you had managed to capture more of the hoop as well as the shot loses it''s leading line', '2006-01-17 01:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046280, 280576, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  especially well lit, even under the brim of his cap.  probably in trouble with that whole crowd thing.</td>', 'nice capture.  especially well lit, even under the brim of his cap.  probably in trouble with that whole crowd thing.', '2006-01-17 01:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046301, 281237, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice feel.  blue enhances it.  like how that one guys is watching her movements.  i wish she was doing something more seductive with her hand rather than messing with whatever she''s messing with.  like stiring a drink or holding a cigarette.</td>', 'nice feel.  blue enhances it.  like how that one guys is watching her movements.  i wish she was doing something more seductive with her hand rather than messing with whatever she''s messing with.  like stiring a drink or holding a cigarette.', '2006-01-17 01:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046326, 279819, 13688, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  the guy''s face buried in the magazine is a bit odd.  the guy in the foreground sort of infringes on your subject a bit too much.  but the person in the very back is interesting in they look sick.  perhaps waiting a few moments for another composition could have put everything in place.  btw very nice focus on the subject for what must have been an awkward situation to take a candid photo.</td>', 'cool idea.  the guy''s face buried in the magazine is a bit odd.  the guy in the foreground sort of infringes on your subject a bit too much.  but the person in the very back is interesting in they look sick.  perhaps waiting a few moments for another composition could have put everything in place.  btw very nice focus on the subject for what must have been an awkward situation to take a candid photo.', '2006-01-17 01:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046354, 281318, 13688, '<td valign="top">this is excellent in meeting the challenge description, but your composition outside of the challenge has left me feeling like this is a random snapshot</td>', 'this is excellent in meeting the challenge description, but your composition outside of the challenge has left me feeling like this is a random snapshot', '2006-01-17 01:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046533, 279085, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great, the only one calm, great idea.</td>', 'Great, the only one calm, great idea.', '2006-01-17 02:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046543, 280547, 16046, '<td valign="top">Well done, great idea with the long exposure.</td>', 'Well done, great idea with the long exposure.', '2006-01-17 02:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046546, 281806, 16046, '<td valign="top">Well done, good find</td>', 'Well done, good find', '2006-01-17 03:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046578, 279671, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great one, I hope you knew the guy, powerful stare. Ok, second look, I mean 5th time I went back to this. He reminds me of Mel Brooks. You really nailed this one, such a busy croud, everyone is looking in a different direction and that hat the subject is wearing, perfect. I''m bumping you up to a 10.</td>', 'Great one, I hope you knew the guy, powerful stare. Ok, second look, I mean 5th time I went back to this. He reminds me of Mel Brooks. You really nailed this one, such a busy croud, everyone is looking in a different direction and that hat the subject is wearing, perfect. I''m bumping you up to a 10.', '2006-01-17 03:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046754, 281033, 30929, '<td valign="top">this is an amazing shot.. congrats.. wish I could vote on these members challenges!!!</td>', 'this is an amazing shot.. congrats.. wish I could vote on these members challenges!!!', '2006-01-17 04:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046763, 280547, 30929, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot... the clarity of the still figure versus the movement of the moving characters is one that I often find looks like accidental camera shake.  The absolute contrast between the still and the moving gives great purpose to the composition.  An angaging capture... Well Done!!</td>', 'This is a great shot... the clarity of the still figure versus the movement of the moving characters is one that I often find looks like accidental camera shake.  The absolute contrast between the still and the moving gives great purpose to the composition.  An angaging capture... Well Done!!', '2006-01-17 04:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046764, 281817, 30929, '<td valign="top">nice shot.. has a wonderful "boulevarde of broken dreams" feeling... <br/> <br/>returning for additional comments. This is my favourite shot!</td>', 'nice shot.. has a wonderful "boulevarde of broken dreams" feeling...  returning for additional comments. This is my favourite shot!', '2006-01-17 04:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
