(2053299, 279654, 30881, '<td valign="top">You captured an excellent expression. IMO this is the best portraiture in the challenge Very well done!!</td>', 'You captured an excellent expression. IMO this is the best portraiture in the challenge Very well done!!', '2006-01-18 09:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053304, 281806, 37334, '<td valign="top">Excellent - the couple look like they have singled themselves out:) And everyone else looks happy despite the rain..and theyall look grey because of the waterproofs, which contrasts nicely with the wedding suit.</td>', 'Excellent - the couple look like they have singled themselves out:) And everyone else looks happy despite the rain..and theyall look grey because of the waterproofs, which contrasts nicely with the wedding suit.', '2006-01-18 09:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053311, 280916, 37334, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and natural.I like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'Beautiful and natural.I like the B&W.', '2006-01-18 09:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053322, 281998, 37334, '<td valign="top">There''s a wonderful story behind those eyes and that expression. Lovely B&amp;W 9</td>', 'There''s a wonderful story behind those eyes and that expression. Lovely B&W 9', '2006-01-18 09:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053337, 280404, 37334, '<td valign="top">This is great. There is a lovelt line of people taking the viewr''s eye diagonally from the left to the right. The colour treatment is effective and she has a lovely natural expression.9</td>', 'This is great. There is a lovelt line of people taking the viewr''s eye diagonally from the left to the right. The colour treatment is effective and she has a lovely natural expression.9', '2006-01-18 09:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053347, 281237, 37334, '<td valign="top">I love the blue, nightclub feel. Another pretty face.</td>', 'I love the blue, nightclub feel. Another pretty face.', '2006-01-18 09:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053362, 279671, 37334, '<td valign="top">Wow! Was he a plant? I mean he''s a friend, not a cactus:)? Great capture. Would make a great poster:)Loving the B&amp;W 10</td>', 'Wow! Was he a plant? I mean he''s a friend, not a cactus:)? Great capture. Would make a great poster:)Loving the B&W 10', '2006-01-18 09:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053377, 281817, 37334, '<td valign="top">Another great image in this challenge! I just wish his bottom half was more defined or contrasty, but that''s only a minor moan;)</td>', 'Another great image in this challenge! I just wish his bottom half was more defined or contrasty, but that''s only a minor moan;)', '2006-01-18 09:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053405, 280288, 37334, '<td valign="top">I think I know where she wants to stick those parking tickets...I hope you ran for the hills before she caught up with you:) Great capture, you deserve a ribbon just for having the *****</td>', 'I think I know where she wants to stick those parking tickets...I hope you ran for the hills before she caught up with you:) Great capture, you deserve a ribbon just for having the *****', '2006-01-18 09:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053419, 279769, 37334, '<td valign="top">So many great B&amp;Ws in this challenge! A lovely face full of a history of pleasure and pain. The women behind create a lovely diagonal helping to move the viewer''s eye across the image. They almost look like they are at church kneeling at a pew! He looks as if they are looking for him and he''s wondering which way to run:))10</td>', 'So many great B&Ws in this challenge! A lovely face full of a history of pleasure and pain. The women behind create a lovely diagonal helping to move the viewer''s eye across the image. They almost look like they are at church kneeling at a pew! He looks as if they are looking for him and he''s wondering which way to run:))10', '2006-01-18 09:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053464, 279671, 37851, '<td valign="top">uhm...  I think he wants to kill me.  10</td>', 'uhm...  I think he wants to kill me.  10', '2006-01-18 09:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2053982, 281618, 6519, '<td valign="top">Since the challenge very clearly asked for a PERSON in a crowd, I don''t understand why you entered this. But do keep it, it''s a very interesting shot for the family album.</td>', 'Since the challenge very clearly asked for a PERSON in a crowd, I don''t understand why you entered this. But do keep it, it''s a very interesting shot for the family album.', '2006-01-18 11:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054062, 281300, 51410, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, nice focus, feeling atmosphere!<br/> <br/>Nice work!<br/> <br/>Iva</td>', 'Very nice composition, nice focus, feeling atmosphere! Nice work! Iva', '2006-01-18 12:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054142, 279671, 30841, '<td valign="top">This picture is haunting. It definately has an oooooo factor to it.</td>', 'This picture is haunting. It definately has an oooooo factor to it.', '2006-01-18 12:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054371, 281593, 208, '<td valign="top">I like how the kid''s shirt helps to frame the subject''s face.</td>', 'I like how the kid''s shirt helps to frame the subject''s face.', '2006-01-18 13:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054378, 280777, 208, '<td valign="top">It''s great that everyone in the foreground is looking toward that one kid. But what is everyone else looking at? B&amp;W is a good choice to remove clutter and help focus the viewer.</td>', 'It''s great that everyone in the foreground is looking toward that one kid. But what is everyone else looking at? B&W is a good choice to remove clutter and help focus the viewer.', '2006-01-18 13:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054385, 281122, 208, '<td valign="top">great minimalist approach. I might have liked to have more room on the left for balance; I like you gave your subject space.</td>', 'great minimalist approach. I might have liked to have more room on the left for balance; I like you gave your subject space.', '2006-01-18 13:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054397, 280951, 208, '<td valign="top">I''d rather see your subject left of center instead of right. I like how the background color helps to frame him. You''ve captured a great look on his face, too.</td>', 'I''d rather see your subject left of center instead of right. I like how the background color helps to frame him. You''ve captured a great look on his face, too.', '2006-01-18 13:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054401, 281231, 208, '<td valign="top">Good choice to put this at an odd angle. How would this look in black &amp; white?</td>', 'Good choice to put this at an odd angle. How would this look in black & white?', '2006-01-18 13:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054403, 281237, 208, '<td valign="top">I like how she''s centered in the frame; great use of the blue tones. Her expression is so at odds with her surroundings, it sets her apart even more. Nice shot!</td>', 'I like how she''s centered in the frame; great use of the blue tones. Her expression is so at odds with her surroundings, it sets her apart even more. Nice shot!', '2006-01-18 13:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054411, 281357, 208, '<td valign="top">love how assymetrical this is - really helps give this photo an interesting vibe</td>', 'love how assymetrical this is - really helps give this photo an interesting vibe', '2006-01-18 13:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054421, 280288, 208, '<td valign="top">That''s a great expression you''ve captured. Overall, though, I''d like to see her legs; there''s just this black trunk going down where they should be. I''ll ignore the pole sticking out of her head since it''s out of focus, but the whole shot (including her) seems grainy.</td>', 'That''s a great expression you''ve captured. Overall, though, I''d like to see her legs; there''s just this black trunk going down where they should be. I''ll ignore the pole sticking out of her head since it''s out of focus, but the whole shot (including her) seems grainy.', '2006-01-18 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054628, 280760, 35804, '<td valign="top">Ah...very nice...looks like an image from a fashion spread seeing as she is so chicly dressed...one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Ah...very nice...looks like an image from a fashion spread seeing as she is so chicly dressed...one of the best in the challenge.', '2006-01-18 14:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054633, 280462, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love the color..gives the image a really cool energy.</td>', 'I love the color..gives the image a really cool energy.', '2006-01-18 14:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054644, 279671, 50651, '<td valign="top">Fierce! Fits the prompt</td>', 'Fierce! Fits the prompt', '2006-01-18 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054646, 280725, 35804, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Echos of " The Eccentric "...beautiful work.</td>', 'Wonderful! Echos of " The Eccentric "...beautiful work.', '2006-01-18 15:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054656, 279671, 35804, '<td valign="top">...yes...I think this is my very favorite...there is nothing more powerful then eye contact as far as making one stand out in a crowd I think...the tones are also so pleasing...a fantastic image.</td>', '...yes...I think this is my very favorite...there is nothing more powerful then eye contact as far as making one stand out in a crowd I think...the tones are also so pleasing...a fantastic image.', '2006-01-18 15:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054663, 281033, 35804, '<td valign="top">The subtle lighting of this makes it memorable...one of my top pics.</td>', 'The subtle lighting of this makes it memorable...one of my top pics.', '2006-01-18 15:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054668, 280951, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just find this image so appealing..the subdued light, the vibrant color in the background, the concentration on his face...well done.</td>', 'I just find this image so appealing..the subdued light, the vibrant color in the background, the concentration on his face...well done.', '2006-01-18 15:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054691, 281891, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but a bit unclear what the green thing is (is it a toy?).  Perhaps should have included more of it in the frame.</td>', 'Nice shot, but a bit unclear what the green thing is (is it a toy?).  Perhaps should have included more of it in the frame.', '2006-01-18 15:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054709, 281593, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice subject - he looks like a character out of a movie.  The composition can use some improvement, though, there is too much going on in this shot, IMO.</td>', 'Nice subject - he looks like a character out of a movie.  The composition can use some improvement, though, there is too much going on in this shot, IMO.', '2006-01-18 15:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054717, 280951, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I was going to comment on how there is less space in the frame where the priest is looking, than behind his back, but perhaps this composition adds some food for thought: it''s as if the priest has turned his back to the colouful world behind him.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I was going to comment on how there is less space in the frame where the priest is looking, than behind his back, but perhaps this composition adds some food for thought: it''s as if the priest has turned his back to the colouful world behind him.', '2006-01-18 15:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054729, 281613, 48890, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t work very well for me.  Perhaps it would work better if the other two birds were a bit sharper.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t work very well for me.  Perhaps it would work better if the other two birds were a bit sharper.', '2006-01-18 15:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054739, 281565, 48890, '<td valign="top">A very nice moment, well framed, good use of DOF.</td>', 'A very nice moment, well framed, good use of DOF.', '2006-01-18 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2054759, 279671, 50166, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  This one is extremely interesting- great use of desaturation</td>', 'Great picture!  This one is extremely interesting- great use of desaturation', '2006-01-18 15:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
