(2055181, 281642, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the look of the main subject.  The rest of the shot is a bit too dark for my liking.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the look of the main subject.  The rest of the shot is a bit too dark for my liking.', '2006-01-18 17:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
