(2057626, 281237, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice shot technically, but, in my opinion, not very interesting compositionally and otherwise.  The woman is caught picking something up from the bar stand... well, so what?</td>', 'A nice shot technically, but, in my opinion, not very interesting compositionally and otherwise.  The woman is caught picking something up from the bar stand... well, so what?', '2006-01-19 02:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057642, 281231, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the girl, but I think that the other children in the frame don''t add anything to the photograph.</td>', 'Nice shot of the girl, but I think that the other children in the frame don''t add anything to the photograph.', '2006-01-19 02:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057647, 281887, 48890, '<td valign="top">Which of the old ladies is singled out?  And how is the half-face on the right justified compositionally?  I think that it happened by mistake, and, while it does demonstrate how DOF works, the shot is not an interesting one.</td>', 'Which of the old ladies is singled out?  And how is the half-face on the right justified compositionally?  I think that it happened by mistake, and, while it does demonstrate how DOF works, the shot is not an interesting one.', '2006-01-19 02:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057648, 279671, 45857, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.<br/>Makes me think of unpleasant names, like "gestapo" or "KGB".</td>', 'Fantastic image.Makes me think of unpleasant names, like "gestapo" or "KGB".', '2006-01-19 02:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057650, 279671, 48890, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much, but, with the DOF of virtually infinity here, I don''t think it fits into the contest.</td>', 'I like this shot very much, but, with the DOF of virtually infinity here, I don''t think it fits into the contest.', '2006-01-19 02:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057653, 280253, 48890, '<td valign="top">The composition is a bit boring, having the main subject in the middle of the frame, and there isn''t all that much to single her out from...</td>', 'The composition is a bit boring, having the main subject in the middle of the frame, and there isn''t all that much to single her out from...', '2006-01-19 02:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057655, 279769, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  I like this shot for everything except the composition.  The eye enters the frame on the left, and then sees the main subject''s face immediately, but then has nothing else of interest to see.  Perhaps flipping it horizontally would produce a more appealing shot.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  I like this shot for everything except the composition.  The eye enters the frame on the left, and then sees the main subject''s face immediately, but then has nothing else of interest to see.  Perhaps flipping it horizontally would produce a more appealing shot.', '2006-01-19 02:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057661, 280463, 48890, '<td valign="top">Singling out worked, alright, but I just don''t find the composition interesting.</td>', 'Singling out worked, alright, but I just don''t find the composition interesting.', '2006-01-19 02:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057664, 281222, 48890, '<td valign="top">The kid is cute, but why is this shot interesting to the others?  The objects in the left part of the frame, whatever it is, does not add to the photo anything other than demonstrating how DOF works, and the same can be said about the kid no the right.</td>', 'The kid is cute, but why is this shot interesting to the others?  The objects in the left part of the frame, whatever it is, does not add to the photo anything other than demonstrating how DOF works, and the same can be said about the kid no the right.', '2006-01-19 02:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057668, 281729, 48890, '<td valign="top">THe main subject is singled out, but, compositionally, this shot is not good.  The out-of-focus objects don''t add anything to the composition.</td>', 'THe main subject is singled out, but, compositionally, this shot is not good.  The out-of-focus objects don''t add anything to the composition.', '2006-01-19 02:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
