(2057719, 281793, 48890, '<td valign="top">This could be a very nice shot, but I don''t like the composition, with the lamp sticking out of the bench, the lamp being dead in the middle of the picture.  Also, there is not one sharp object in the shot, and DOF isolation is not used.</td>', 'This could be a very nice shot, but I don''t like the composition, with the lamp sticking out of the bench, the lamp being dead in the middle of the picture.  Also, there is not one sharp object in the shot, and DOF isolation is not used.', '2006-01-19 03:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057722, 280916, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, good use of DOF isolation.</td>', 'A nice shot, good use of DOF isolation.', '2006-01-19 03:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2057725, 281861, 48890, '<td valign="top">DOF isolation is not used sufficiently, and, compositionally, this shot is very messy.</td>', 'DOF isolation is not used sufficiently, and, compositionally, this shot is very messy.', '2006-01-19 03:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
