(2058309, 281593, 22517, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, although the colors are a bit too dull for my taste. I like the DOF and expression on the man in the middle.</td>', 'Very nice capture, although the colors are a bit too dull for my taste. I like the DOF and expression on the man in the middle.', '2006-01-19 07:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058317, 279819, 22517, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF, meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF, meets the challenge well.', '2006-01-19 07:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058319, 281219, 22517, '<td valign="top">Great how you captured the moment they were all looking your way. The 2 in the middle are well focused. Nice.</td>', 'Great how you captured the moment they were all looking your way. The 2 in the middle are well focused. Nice.', '2006-01-19 07:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058324, 281904, 22517, '<td valign="top">Very good subject, good use of DOF.</td>', 'Very good subject, good use of DOF.', '2006-01-19 07:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058329, 279671, 22517, '<td valign="top">Wonderful how the subject stands out in the crowd, although DOF could have been shallower. Great expression on the model''s face.</td>', 'Wonderful how the subject stands out in the crowd, although DOF could have been shallower. Great expression on the model''s face.', '2006-01-19 07:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058577, 281593, 37334, '<td valign="top">Great expression and nice muted colour</td>', 'Great expression and nice muted colour', '2006-01-19 08:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058737, 280288, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice moment.  I think that DOF isolation is not used sufficiently in this picture for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice moment.  I think that DOF isolation is not used sufficiently in this picture for this challenge.', '2006-01-19 09:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058746, 280434, 48890, '<td valign="top">DOF isolation is not used sufficiently in this picture.  Composition-wise, I don''t think cutting off the heads of the other people was a good idea.  Perhaps leave only the legs, or include them entirely.  This is a difficult subject, and you need to be careful photographing it.</td>', 'DOF isolation is not used sufficiently in this picture.  Composition-wise, I don''t think cutting off the heads of the other people was a good idea.  Perhaps leave only the legs, or include them entirely.  This is a difficult subject, and you need to be careful photographing it.', '2006-01-19 09:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058753, 281734, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice moment.  I think that the out-of-focus people do not add anything to the shot, other than demonstrate how DOF works.</td>', 'Nice moment.  I think that the out-of-focus people do not add anything to the shot, other than demonstrate how DOF works.', '2006-01-19 09:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058760, 281755, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good use of DOF.  Sorry, but the shot does not grab me, so not a full mark.</td>', 'Nice shot, good use of DOF.  Sorry, but the shot does not grab me, so not a full mark.', '2006-01-19 09:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058769, 280917, 48890, '<td valign="top">DOF isolation is barely used in this picture.  The farthest set of feet is just as in focus as the middle one. Composition-wise I don''t find this shot interesting, sorry.</td>', 'DOF isolation is barely used in this picture.  The farthest set of feet is just as in focus as the middle one. Composition-wise I don''t find this shot interesting, sorry.', '2006-01-19 09:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058773, 281266, 48890, '<td valign="top">DOF isolztion is not used in this picture (a requirement).</td>', 'DOF isolztion is not used in this picture (a requirement).', '2006-01-19 09:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058776, 281272, 48890, '<td valign="top">Some use of DOF isolation, but you should have used more.  The other children in the shot don''t add anything to it.</td>', 'Some use of DOF isolation, but you should have used more.  The other children in the shot don''t add anything to it.', '2006-01-19 09:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058873, 281586, 48890, '<td valign="top">I see here an isolation from moving subjects by long exposure.  Strictly, DOF isolation was a requirement for this contest.  In case of this picture, I don''t think that the shadows of the moving people, the reflection in the glass, the column growing out of the head of the main subject, and the defaced woman in the background, add anything to the composition.</td>', 'I see here an isolation from moving subjects by long exposure.  Strictly, DOF isolation was a requirement for this contest.  In case of this picture, I don''t think that the shadows of the moving people, the reflection in the glass, the column growing out of the head of the main subject, and the defaced woman in the background, add anything to the composition.', '2006-01-19 10:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058878, 281440, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Strictly speaking, there isn''t a whole lot of other things happening in the shot, to isolate the main subject from.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Strictly speaking, there isn''t a whole lot of other things happening in the shot, to isolate the main subject from.', '2006-01-19 10:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058890, 281352, 48890, '<td valign="top">DOF isolation is not used sufficiently in this shot.  Also, the composition is not very good: there shot is a bit messy, e.g. the half-face of a woman in the foreground doesn''t add anything to it.</td>', 'DOF isolation is not used sufficiently in this shot.  Also, the composition is not very good: there shot is a bit messy, e.g. the half-face of a woman in the foreground doesn''t add anything to it.', '2006-01-19 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058918, 280547, 48890, '<td valign="top">You are not using DOF isolation (a requirement) in this shot.  However, long-exposure isolation from moving subjects is working rather nicely here; I don''t particularly like the outcome, particularly the ghost of a man just behind the woman, the way that the legs are cut off the other "ghosts", the reflection of an escalator in the glass, and the placement of the main subject dead in the middle of the frame.</td>', 'You are not using DOF isolation (a requirement) in this shot.  However, long-exposure isolation from moving subjects is working rather nicely here; I don''t particularly like the outcome, particularly the ghost of a man just behind the woman, the way that the legs are cut off the other "ghosts", the reflection of an escalator in the glass, and the placement of the main subject dead in the middle of the frame.', '2006-01-19 10:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058920, 279769, 48722, '<td valign="top">awesome contrast! love it!!</td>', 'awesome contrast! love it!!', '2006-01-19 10:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058922, 281033, 48890, '<td valign="top">Thre is some use of DOF isolation in this shot, but it seems to me that the wall in the BG is more in focus than the head of the main subject.  The composition isn''t working for me, sorry.</td>', 'Thre is some use of DOF isolation in this shot, but it seems to me that the wall in the BG is more in focus than the head of the main subject.  The composition isn''t working for me, sorry.', '2006-01-19 10:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058928, 281537, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  The OOF subjects did not render very pleasantly in this shot.  Otherwise I would have given it full marks.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  The OOF subjects did not render very pleasantly in this shot.  Otherwise I would have given it full marks.', '2006-01-19 10:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058942, 281870, 48890, '<td valign="top">Okay, the runner in the background is singled out using shallow DOF, which is a good thing.  HOwever, compositionally, even if you envisioned your shot with the third runner in focus (meaning that it didn''t happen by focusing mistake), I don''t understand how this shot is interesting compositionally.  You''ve included one eye, a nose, and half the mouse of the main subject.  I don''t think that the OOF people add anything to the frame.</td>', 'Okay, the runner in the background is singled out using shallow DOF, which is a good thing.  HOwever, compositionally, even if you envisioned your shot with the third runner in focus (meaning that it didn''t happen by focusing mistake), I don''t understand how this shot is interesting compositionally.  You''ve included one eye, a nose, and half the mouse of the main subject.  I don''t think that the OOF people add anything to the frame.', '2006-01-19 10:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058944, 281543, 48890, '<td valign="top">I am not seeing any DOF subject isolation in this shot, sorry.</td>', 'I am not seeing any DOF subject isolation in this shot, sorry.', '2006-01-19 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2058949, 280760, 48890, '<td valign="top">There''s  hardly any DOF isolation used in this shot. The woman on the bike is a worthy subject, but I don''t think that the back of the man in the FG adds anything to the picture.</td>', 'There''s  hardly any DOF isolation used in this shot. The woman on the bike is a worthy subject, but I don''t think that the back of the man in the FG adds anything to the picture.', '2006-01-19 10:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059261, 279671, 23053, '<td valign="top">Captivating...like an adult version of Where''s Waldo.  The B&amp;W is stunning and well done, and the deep DOF, rather than the shallow one seen in most other shots here, gives us a lot to see.  It''s gonna be tough, but I think you have a good shot at the top prize.  Regardless of whether you get it or not, this is still one hell of a shot.</td>', 'Captivating...like an adult version of Where''s Waldo.  The B&W is stunning and well done, and the deep DOF, rather than the shallow one seen in most other shots here, gives us a lot to see.  It''s gonna be tough, but I think you have a good shot at the top prize.  Regardless of whether you get it or not, this is still one hell of a shot.', '2006-01-19 11:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059570, 281213, 26255, '<td valign="top">Overall this is a very busy image.  Neither subject seems to be "singled out" and they actually both seem to be competing for attention.  The nearest subject grabs your attention initially, but the focus and lighting is on your distant subject.  The focus on her seems a bit soft, and she is dominated by the near subject.  In short, I can''t really tell who is "singled out".</td>', 'Overall this is a very busy image.  Neither subject seems to be "singled out" and they actually both seem to be competing for attention.  The nearest subject grabs your attention initially, but the focus and lighting is on your distant subject.  The focus on her seems a bit soft, and she is dominated by the near subject.  In short, I can''t really tell who is "singled out".', '2006-01-19 13:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059583, 281300, 26255, '<td valign="top">Honestly, the selective desat doesn''t work for me on this one.  It''s a good shot, but the selective desat gives it too much of an artificial feel for me.</td>', 'Honestly, the selective desat doesn''t work for me on this one.  It''s a good shot, but the selective desat gives it too much of an artificial feel for me.', '2006-01-19 13:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059679, 281899, 5885, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture... but a B+W treatment might have worked well for you to help with the WB issues</td>', 'This is a nice capture... but a B+W treatment might have worked well for you to help with the WB issues', '2006-01-19 13:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059703, 281901, 5885, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful capture... love the ambience in lighting and that your subject is truly singled out by the fact that he is silouetted</td>', 'Wow, beautiful capture... love the ambience in lighting and that your subject is truly singled out by the fact that he is silouetted', '2006-01-19 14:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059711, 281921, 5885, '<td valign="top">I never want to pass the DNMC judgement on any photo, but this challenge was specifically supposed to be candids.</td>', 'I never want to pass the DNMC judgement on any photo, but this challenge was specifically supposed to be candids.', '2006-01-19 14:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059715, 281300, 5885, '<td valign="top">Beautiful post processing here... I think you''ve done a good job of singling out the fearless musician with both an interesting composition and creative post-processing. Initially voted it a 9... coming back for a bump to 10.</td>', 'Beautiful post processing here... I think you''ve done a good job of singling out the fearless musician with both an interesting composition and creative post-processing. Initially voted it a 9... coming back for a bump to 10.', '2006-01-19 14:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059723, 281945, 5885, '<td valign="top">Ahhh... the nude workshop :-) those are always fun. I''m giving you an 8... <br/> <br/>I''d like to see a few things changed. First, I''d prefer the model be in sharp focus and the photographers be further on the edges of the DoF. I believe this would have a better effect of singling her out.<br/> <br/>Crop could have been a little tighter on the right and bottom also. There are some distractions in these areas.</td>', 'Ahhh... the nude workshop :-) those are always fun. I''m giving you an 8...  I''d like to see a few things changed. First, I''d prefer the model be in sharp focus and the photographers be further on the edges of the DoF. I believe this would have a better effect of singling her out. Crop could have been a little tighter on the right and bottom also. There are some distractions in these areas.', '2006-01-19 14:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059726, 279671, 5885, '<td valign="top">Quite frankly, one of my favorite captures in this challenge. You''ve successfully isolated one face in a fairly large crowd. That''s not an easy task. Good work. 10!</td>', 'Quite frankly, one of my favorite captures in this challenge. You''ve successfully isolated one face in a fairly large crowd. That''s not an easy task. Good work. 10!', '2006-01-19 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059974, 279671, 50289, '<td valign="top">So eerie!  The guy in the center of the picture appears to be floating in the croud.  Great shot!</td>', 'So eerie!  The guy in the center of the picture appears to be floating in the croud.  Great shot!', '2006-01-19 15:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060073, 280725, 32221, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot, one of my favourites</td>', 'A wonderful shot, one of my favourites', '2006-01-19 15:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060074, 281593, 32221, '<td valign="top">This is great! very nice capture.</td>', 'This is great! very nice capture.', '2006-01-19 15:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
