(2060154, 280547, 26318, '<td valign="top">I like this one, the blue shirt really stands out in the blurred greys. I like that no one else is not blurred.. Well done.</td>', 'I like this one, the blue shirt really stands out in the blurred greys. I like that no one else is not blurred.. Well done.', '2006-01-19 16:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
