(2060973, 281272, 43410, '<td valign="top">great job, beautiful children.  little soft, but great shot.  works well.  8</td>', 'great job, beautiful children.  little soft, but great shot.  works well.  8', '2006-01-19 19:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061265, 281806, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is just a great capture ;)</td>', 'This is just a great capture ;)', '2006-01-19 20:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061271, 280589, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm ... I bet you submitted an entry in signs :) The one with the names on the seats ;) I like this perspective view ;)</td>', 'Hmmmm ... I bet you submitted an entry in signs :) The one with the names on the seats ;) I like this perspective view ;)', '2006-01-19 20:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061273, 280725, 37893, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the group ;)</td>', 'One of the best in the group ;)', '2006-01-19 20:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061312, 281805, 26464, '<td valign="top">great use of DOP</td>', 'great use of DOP', '2006-01-19 20:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061323, 281806, 26464, '<td valign="top">wow such a difference in sharpness from main subject to rest... almost like wasnt there</td>', 'wow such a difference in sharpness from main subject to rest... almost like wasnt there', '2006-01-19 21:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061325, 281870, 27556, '<td valign="top">someone in this shot needs to be in focus and no one is.</td>', 'someone in this shot needs to be in focus and no one is.', '2006-01-19 21:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061330, 281565, 26464, '<td valign="top">hey i''ve seen these kids! they''re posing!!!! ;-)</td>', 'hey i''ve seen these kids! they''re posing!!!! ;-)', '2006-01-19 21:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061333, 281990, 27556, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, the only thing that is bothing me is the soft focus. but very clever and well composed</td>', 'I really like this shot, the only thing that is bothing me is the soft focus. but very clever and well composed', '2006-01-19 21:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061338, 281945, 26464, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2006-01-19 21:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061345, 281266, 27556, '<td valign="top">Naked Cowboy!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>I love that guy, he turns up everywhere. Crazy guy even out in the rain. <br/>I liked that you used a fisheye lens on this gives that full perspective of times square for him to stand out of. I just wish there was more light on his face, but only so much can be done with his hat ;)</td>', 'Naked Cowboy!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! I love that guy, he turns up everywhere. Crazy guy even out in the rain. I liked that you used a fisheye lens on this gives that full perspective of times square for him to stand out of. I just wish there was more light on his face, but only so much can be done with his hat ;)', '2006-01-19 21:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061349, 279671, 26464, '<td valign="top">oh this would have been twice as good cropped further in... with all those faces and the lone man in the middle staring back... very good. you can''t get a 12, but i''ll give you a 6.</td>', 'oh this would have been twice as good cropped further in... with all those faces and the lone man in the middle staring back... very good. you can''t get a 12, but i''ll give you a 6.', '2006-01-19 21:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061350, 281318, 27556, '<td valign="top">I cant really tell who is supposed to be singled out in this shot</td>', 'I cant really tell who is supposed to be singled out in this shot', '2006-01-19 21:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061358, 281734, 26464, '<td valign="top">is this a coley? very cool</td>', 'is this a coley? very cool', '2006-01-19 21:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061626, 281257, 29269, '<td valign="top">I am not against post-processing blurring, but if it is done in such way to make the shot unreal, it takes away from it. E.g. the sand shore behind the kid is relatively sharp and in focus, while the lady next to the kid is out of focus. Should have blurred some of that shore to the left of the kid''s head. 5 for trying.</td>', 'I am not against post-processing blurring, but if it is done in such way to make the shot unreal, it takes away from it. E.g. the sand shore behind the kid is relatively sharp and in focus, while the lady next to the kid is out of focus. Should have blurred some of that shore to the left of the kid''s head. 5 for trying.', '2006-01-19 22:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061656, 280288, 29269, '<td valign="top">What I want to know is... did she kick your butt? Nice capture!</td>', 'What I want to know is... did she kick your butt? Nice capture!', '2006-01-19 22:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061662, 281327, 13688, '<td valign="top">wow, that blurry girl is very ingaging.  her expression and movement is very dynamic.  unfortunately i can''t figure out from the title or the composition what exactly you were trying to achieve with this image</td>', 'wow, that blurry girl is very ingaging.  her expression and movement is very dynamic.  unfortunately i can''t figure out from the title or the composition what exactly you were trying to achieve with this image', '2006-01-19 22:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061672, 281397, 29269, '<td valign="top">Billy Gibbons running the marathon in his hometown? Nah... but still very pretty capture. Not sure about the b/w choice, you could have bumped the contrast a bit to make the image stand out some more...</td>', 'Billy Gibbons running the marathon in his hometown? Nah... but still very pretty capture. Not sure about the b/w choice, you could have bumped the contrast a bit to make the image stand out some more...', '2006-01-19 22:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061674, 280404, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like this.  i especially like how you further separated her from the crowd with her gazing in the opposite direction of everyone else</td>', 'i really like this.  i especially like how you further separated her from the crowd with her gazing in the opposite direction of everyone else', '2006-01-19 22:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061678, 280669, 29269, '<td valign="top">Maybe a better choice would have been to have focused on the girl in red shirt... your singled-out subject has too much of her face covered for effective presentation.</td>', 'Maybe a better choice would have been to have focused on the girl in red shirt... your singled-out subject has too much of her face covered for effective presentation.', '2006-01-19 22:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061696, 280463, 13688, '<td valign="top">very vibrant.  perhaps a bit more care with your photoshop blurring would help improve the image.</td>', 'very vibrant.  perhaps a bit more care with your photoshop blurring would help improve the image.', '2006-01-19 22:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061718, 281806, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting group.  there seems to be a lot of intriguing subjects in the stands.  be a bit more careful with your postprocessing, as your main subject''s outline makes him look pasted in....unless of course you were going for something more bizarre looking.</td>', 'interesting group.  there seems to be a lot of intriguing subjects in the stands.  be a bit more careful with your postprocessing, as your main subject''s outline makes him look pasted in....unless of course you were going for something more bizarre looking.', '2006-01-19 22:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061751, 280689, 13688, '<td valign="top">very clean and well lit photo.  I wish you had shot something that better conveys the hopeful bustle of a market.</td>', 'very clean and well lit photo.  I wish you had shot something that better conveys the hopeful bustle of a market.', '2006-01-19 22:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061782, 281995, 13688, '<td valign="top">this is cool.  i feel like i''ve been there all night partying.  i like how you timed it so that the bud light sign was directly over her head.  bartender...i''d like another shot of tequila.</td>', 'this is cool.  i feel like i''ve been there all night partying.  i like how you timed it so that the bud light sign was directly over her head.  bartender...i''d like another shot of tequila.', '2006-01-19 22:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061815, 281805, 29269, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the purity (i.e. avoiding artificial DOF enhancement), but this one could have benefited from the gradual blurring. Still a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'I appreciate the purity (i.e. avoiding artificial DOF enhancement), but this one could have benefited from the gradual blurring. Still a good take on the challenge.', '2006-01-19 22:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061831, 280725, 32139, '<td valign="top">Interesting face. I would have moved the individual to the left to give the eye more space and avoid an almost centered image.</td>', 'Interesting face. I would have moved the individual to the left to give the eye more space and avoid an almost centered image.', '2006-01-19 22:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061835, 281990, 32139, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice. The slant toward left bottom s nevertheless unsetling</td>', 'Interesting choice. The slant toward left bottom s nevertheless unsetling', '2006-01-19 22:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061837, 281729, 32139, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the face</td>', 'Nice framing of the face', '2006-01-19 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061845, 280404, 32139, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal line with the faces. A little bit more contrast would have been nice.</td>', 'Nice diagonal line with the faces. A little bit more contrast would have been nice.', '2006-01-19 22:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061864, 281806, 32139, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the rain gears and the formal costume. I do not like as much the increased blur of the background. I looks too artifical.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the rain gears and the formal costume. I do not like as much the increased blur of the background. I looks too artifical.', '2006-01-19 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061868, 281122, 32139, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Good contrast.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Good contrast.', '2006-01-19 22:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061903, 280883, 32139, '<td valign="top">I like the icy blue look of the photo. Like less the void behind the woman. Would have crop on the right side to give the eye more space. Would also have waited for a less grinnish look.</td>', 'I like the icy blue look of the photo. Like less the void behind the woman. Would have crop on the right side to give the eye more space. Would also have waited for a less grinnish look.', '2006-01-19 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061918, 281015, 32139, '<td valign="top">Hug contrast .. may be a bit too much. Nice use of the vertical framing. I would have made sure to straighten the building (made really vertical) in the background. This would have avoided the overall feeling of a left fall.</td>', 'Hug contrast .. may be a bit too much. Nice use of the vertical framing. I would have made sure to straighten the building (made really vertical) in the background. This would have avoided the overall feeling of a left fall.', '2006-01-19 23:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061940, 281995, 29269, '<td valign="top">That hand is kinda low, but at the same time not low enough. Make up your mind, either 5 inches up or 5 inches down!<br/>Oh, yes, singled-out... meets the challenge, it is not DOF as much as lighting that accentuates the couple, but that is perfectly acceptable. My personal take on the challenge description is that it offers a guideline, not hard and fast rule. That said, while it meets the challenge, it does not have that wow factor that differentiates this photo from an average snapshot. Hence the average score, 6.</td>', 'That hand is kinda low, but at the same time not low enough. Make up your mind, either 5 inches up or 5 inches down!Oh, yes, singled-out... meets the challenge, it is not DOF as much as lighting that accentuates the couple, but that is perfectly acceptable. My personal take on the challenge description is that it offers a guideline, not hard and fast rule. That said, while it meets the challenge, it does not have that wow factor that differentiates this photo from an average snapshot. Hence the average score, 6.', '2006-01-19 23:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061956, 279671, 29269, '<td valign="top">Bump up to 10 on the second run-through. If this is not in top 5, I don''t know what is. Absolutely fantastic, staged or not I don''t care, nor it should matter. Good luck!</td>', 'Bump up to 10 on the second run-through. If this is not in top 5, I don''t know what is. Absolutely fantastic, staged or not I don''t care, nor it should matter. Good luck!', '2006-01-19 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2061972, 280547, 29269, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling here between 9 and 10... the composition, clarity, theme, subject, everything is perfect. The only thing I am trying to decide on is whether there is enough of background ''noise'' to consider this an exceptional ''meet the challenge'' i.e. singled out photo. I''ll bump to 10, just in case. Good luck!</td>', 'I''m struggling here between 9 and 10... the composition, clarity, theme, subject, everything is perfect. The only thing I am trying to decide on is whether there is enough of background ''noise'' to consider this an exceptional ''meet the challenge'' i.e. singled out photo. I''ll bump to 10, just in case. Good luck!', '2006-01-19 23:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062518, 280434, 50591, '<td valign="top">Amazing.</td>', 'Amazing.', '2006-01-20 02:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062761, 281183, 40469, '<td valign="top">To bad this ain''t really singled out, it''s a real nice pic!</td>', 'To bad this ain''t really singled out, it''s a real nice pic!', '2006-01-20 06:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062773, 279671, 40469, '<td valign="top">Really intrigue-ing (sp?) love this one! nicely singled-out. Good choice for duotone.</td>', 'Really intrigue-ing (sp?) love this one! nicely singled-out. Good choice for duotone.', '2006-01-20 06:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062867, 281729, 48680, '<td valign="top">Really nice, love the colours.  Skin tone and hair detail are great. Fits challenge title really well.</td>', 'Really nice, love the colours.  Skin tone and hair detail are great. Fits challenge title really well.', '2006-01-20 07:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062935, 280725, 12611, '<td valign="top">Confucius say.. very nice portrait. I couldn''t resist.</td>', 'Confucius say.. very nice portrait. I couldn''t resist.', '2006-01-20 08:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063178, 279671, 41536, '<td valign="top">This is great! Meets the Challenge!</td>', 'This is great! Meets the Challenge!', '2006-01-20 09:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063201, 281729, 41536, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing. Singled-out very nicely....</td>', 'Very nice framing. Singled-out very nicely....', '2006-01-20 09:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063779, 281565, 9768, '<td valign="top">giood</td>', 'giood', '2006-01-20 11:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063782, 281945, 9768, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2006-01-20 11:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063827, 281219, 19708, '<td valign="top">"...and single-out a person in a crowd as your source of composition."<br/>Oops - miss the key word - person.<br/>Great picture though!</td>', '"...and single-out a person in a crowd as your source of composition."Oops - miss the key word - person.Great picture though!', '2006-01-20 12:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063829, 281541, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great lighting - side lighting and people can be tough to do.<br/>Girls on the left a little noisy and fairly in focus though. (5)</td>', 'Great lighting - side lighting and people can be tough to do.Girls on the left a little noisy and fairly in focus though. (5)', '2006-01-20 12:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063833, 280589, 19708, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view.<br/>No people here/no crowd - don''t really think the chairs count as a crowd. (4)</td>', 'Interesting point of view.No people here/no crowd - don''t really think the chairs count as a crowd. (4)', '2006-01-20 12:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063835, 279819, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great candid and nails this challenge in my opinion.<br/>Good choice for B &amp; W. (7)</td>', 'Great candid and nails this challenge in my opinion.Good choice for B & W. (7)', '2006-01-20 12:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2063846, 280689, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on this and a clear image.<br/>Crop may have been a little stronger if all the sign on the left would be in the shot, or have it out completely, and perhaps a little less of the foreground material/paper showing. (7)</td>', 'Very nice lighting on this and a clear image.Crop may have been a little stronger if all the sign on the left would be in the shot, or have it out completely, and perhaps a little less of the foreground material/paper showing. (7)', '2006-01-20 12:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
