(2064132, 281500, 48524, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, well-centered and focused.  Great action capture.  I personally would have favored a slightly longer crop--a little off the top and more on the sides, but then again, it''s all up to you.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, well-centered and focused.  Great action capture.  I personally would have favored a slightly longer crop--a little off the top and more on the sides, but then again, it''s all up to you.', '2006-01-20 13:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
