(2064154, 281723, 48524, '<td valign="top">Definitely singled him out, the blurry figures in the foreground really add to the feel.  Would have been interesting if there were a few more figures, at different distances to add to more levels of being ''singled out'' but I guess from where you were taking it you probably couldn''t have controlled that.  Colors are very sharp, I personally have no complaints about bright highlights and harsh shadows.</td>', 'Definitely singled him out, the blurry figures in the foreground really add to the feel.  Would have been interesting if there were a few more figures, at different distances to add to more levels of being ''singled out'' but I guess from where you were taking it you probably couldn''t have controlled that.  Colors are very sharp, I personally have no complaints about bright highlights and harsh shadows.', '2006-01-20 13:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
