(2064297, 279769, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about how you met the challenge. It''s easy to "single out" someone by simply having him be the closest to the camera. But you still meet the challenge with a beautiful photograph, so you get a 9. Talk about having your whole life etched into your face!</td>', 'I''m not crazy about how you met the challenge. It''s easy to "single out" someone by simply having him be the closest to the camera. But you still meet the challenge with a beautiful photograph, so you get a 9. Talk about having your whole life etched into your face!', '2006-01-20 14:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064314, 281005, 50695, '<td valign="top">seems like a "busy" photo but the eye is inevitably drawn to lady liberty. 8 just for fulfilling the challenge so well.</td>', 'seems like a "busy" photo but the eye is inevitably drawn to lady liberty. 8 just for fulfilling the challenge so well.', '2006-01-20 14:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064316, 281990, 50695, '<td valign="top">mountains of sheep! beautiful composition. 8.</td>', 'mountains of sheep! beautiful composition. 8.', '2006-01-20 14:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064328, 281537, 50695, '<td valign="top">a semi-copout on the challenge but who cares when you create such a beautiful picture! This reminds me of my excitement over dinosaurs at that age. 8.</td>', 'a semi-copout on the challenge but who cares when you create such a beautiful picture! This reminds me of my excitement over dinosaurs at that age. 8.', '2006-01-20 14:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064332, 279819, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how he obscures the next person''s face and his own face is almost obscured by the person in front of him, but he just peeks out like a drowning man coming up for air. great composition. 8.</td>', 'I like how he obscures the next person''s face and his own face is almost obscured by the person in front of him, but he just peeks out like a drowning man coming up for air. great composition. 8.', '2006-01-20 14:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064346, 281995, 51667, '<td valign="top">Youve certainly caught the feeling, maybe a little more concentration on focus and light next time.</td>', 'Youve certainly caught the feeling, maybe a little more concentration on focus and light next time.', '2006-01-20 14:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064349, 281734, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like when an almost-hidden, almost-obscure person is singled out. that plus black angel wings. How can you go wrong? 8.</td>', 'I like when an almost-hidden, almost-obscure person is singled out. that plus black angel wings. How can you go wrong? 8.', '2006-01-20 14:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064360, 280288, 50695, '<td valign="top">8 points just for your wonderful subject.</td>', '8 points just for your wonderful subject.', '2006-01-20 15:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064365, 280431, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how the umbrella seems to be compressing her. Cameras love rain for some reason. 8.</td>', 'I love how the umbrella seems to be compressing her. Cameras love rain for some reason. 8.', '2006-01-20 15:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064372, 281480, 50695, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain why I find this so affecting. 8.</td>', 'I can''t explain why I find this so affecting. 8.', '2006-01-20 15:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064374, 280904, 50695, '<td valign="top">Love the child''s expression! 8.</td>', 'Love the child''s expression! 8.', '2006-01-20 15:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064377, 281901, 50695, '<td valign="top">good creative fulfillment of the challenge (for which I''m sure you''ll be penalized by others...) 8.</td>', 'good creative fulfillment of the challenge (for which I''m sure you''ll be penalized by others...) 8.', '2006-01-20 15:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064379, 280917, 50695, '<td valign="top">good creative fulfillment of challenge! 8.</td>', 'good creative fulfillment of challenge! 8.', '2006-01-20 15:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064389, 279085, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how his subjective experience is completely different from everyone else''s. You were one of very few people who had the guts to single someone out with composition more than depth of field. 8.</td>', 'I love how his subjective experience is completely different from everyone else''s. You were one of very few people who had the guts to single someone out with composition more than depth of field. 8.', '2006-01-20 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064395, 281618, 51667, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but I dont think the dog works.</td>', 'Nice composition but I dont think the dog works.', '2006-01-20 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064411, 280615, 50695, '<td valign="top">God, I love reflections. Notice how she is singled out even from her own reflection. 10.</td>', 'God, I love reflections. Notice how she is singled out even from her own reflection. 10.', '2006-01-20 15:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064412, 281300, 51667, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the light on the musician against the black and grey background makes him stick out like a sore thumb.</td>', 'Nice idea but the light on the musician against the black and grey background makes him stick out like a sore thumb.', '2006-01-20 15:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064413, 279671, 50695, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot. I hope that guy isn''t stalking you. I think he''s a vampire. 10</td>', 'Incredible shot. I hope that guy isn''t stalking you. I think he''s a vampire. 10', '2006-01-20 15:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064418, 280760, 50695, '<td valign="top">This captures a sublime moment in which one foregrounded figure and some well-placed vehicles manage to block out all the inhabitants of the city except for this one elegant woman. One is reminded of "Some enchanted evening, you will meet a stranger..." 9.</td>', 'This captures a sublime moment in which one foregrounded figure and some well-placed vehicles manage to block out all the inhabitants of the city except for this one elegant woman. One is reminded of "Some enchanted evening, you will meet a stranger..." 9.', '2006-01-20 15:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064419, 280434, 50695, '<td valign="top">good take on the challenge to single someone out by the "level" they''re on. In this case, ground level. She''s really not so different than the people around her, who also seem to be dissolving into what they''re wearing and what they''re carrying. 9.</td>', 'good take on the challenge to single someone out by the "level" they''re on. In this case, ground level. She''s really not so different than the people around her, who also seem to be dissolving into what they''re wearing and what they''re carrying. 9.', '2006-01-20 15:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064420, 281593, 50695, '<td valign="top">love the sandy color of this, love how everyone is intent on what he''s doing except for the person you''ve singled out. and love his face! and his hat! I want that hat! 9.</td>', 'love the sandy color of this, love how everyone is intent on what he''s doing except for the person you''ve singled out. and love his face! and his hat! I want that hat! 9.', '2006-01-20 15:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064455, 279671, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! This is exactly the type of picture I imagined when they first announced the Singled-Out challenge. Amazing that only 1-2 other people were looking at the camera during this pic.  Nicely done. &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Wonderful shot! This is exactly the type of picture I imagined when they first announced the Singled-Out challenge. Amazing that only 1-2 other people were looking at the camera during this pic.  Nicely done. <10>', '2006-01-20 15:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064462, 280547, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! She''s singled out by motion as well as color. Great job! &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'This is a great shot! She''s singled out by motion as well as color. Great job! <10>', '2006-01-20 15:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064470, 281817, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice take on this challenge!  Good post processing as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice take on this challenge!  Good post processing as well. Nicely done.', '2006-01-20 15:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064486, 281941, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Definitely a character!  I love the male/female juxtaposition and fact that she also plays a prominent role in the shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great shot!  Definitely a character!  I love the male/female juxtaposition and fact that she also plays a prominent role in the shot.  Nicely done.', '2006-01-20 15:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064492, 281734, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great picture! Great sharpness on the angel.  Only thing that could have made it better was if she was looking at the camera (definitely no points off for that).  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great picture! Great sharpness on the angel.  Only thing that could have made it better was if she was looking at the camera (definitely no points off for that).  Nicely done.', '2006-01-20 15:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064500, 280760, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Looks like something from a fashion magazine.  Only critique is that I would have liked her to be a little more prominent in the picture than the man - however, his dark clothing and way he fills the frame also causes your focus to move to the woman.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Great image!  Looks like something from a fashion magazine.  Only critique is that I would have liked her to be a little more prominent in the picture than the man - however, his dark clothing and way he fills the frame also causes your focus to move to the woman.  Very nicely done.', '2006-01-20 15:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064515, 281729, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The softness of the subject melds nicely with the overall light/white feeling of the picture (i.e., no bright colors or harsh lines/sharpening).  Has a magazine appeal to it, nicely done - nice competition!</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The softness of the subject melds nicely with the overall light/white feeling of the picture (i.e., no bright colors or harsh lines/sharpening).  Has a magazine appeal to it, nicely done - nice competition!', '2006-01-20 15:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064534, 279085, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great picture. The image quality is "ok", but the composition and subject meet the challenge perfectly.  I love the juxtaposition of the "cool" brakeman against the screaming riders.  Nice capture - nicely done!</td>', 'Great picture. The image quality is "ok", but the composition and subject meet the challenge perfectly.  I love the juxtaposition of the "cool" brakeman against the screaming riders.  Nice capture - nicely done!', '2006-01-20 15:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064586, 281941, 37893, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF in this image. Sharp and nice use of BW.</td>', 'Love the DOF in this image. Sharp and nice use of BW.', '2006-01-20 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064594, 279671, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this is staged but I still like the contrast in tones and the use of a duotone for this image ;)8</td>', 'I think this is staged but I still like the contrast in tones and the use of a duotone for this image ;)8', '2006-01-20 15:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
