(2067456, 280725, 36006, '<td valign="top">DNMC<br/> <br/>Answering your PM.<br/> <br/>So, I can agree with everyone else that is giving you high marks that this is a fine pix. Your work is very clean. Your portfolio has proven that you do have an eye.<br/> <br/>But unlike people that vote on emotion and not within the confines of this challenge, I claim DNMC? Why? Because this is not singled out. This is a candid shot. <br/> <br/>To convince me of singled out needs at least one more subject weather a person or thing. Yes, your bg is blurred, but does not single out your main subject.<br/> <br/>Great light, nice texture, color great, dof good, nice angle, b&amp;w good, overall great.<br/> <br/>Sorry for the low score.<br/> <br/></td>', 'DNMC Answering your PM. So, I can agree with everyone else that is giving you high marks that this is a fine pix. Your work is very clean. Your portfolio has proven that you do have an eye. But unlike people that vote on emotion and not within the confines of this challenge, I claim DNMC? Why? Because this is not singled out. This is a candid shot.  To convince me of singled out needs at least one more subject weather a person or thing. Yes, your bg is blurred, but does not single out your main subject. Great light, nice texture, color great, dof good, nice angle, b&w good, overall great. Sorry for the low score. ', '2006-01-21 11:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2067464, 280951, 36006, '<td valign="top">DNMC<br/> <br/>Unlike people that vote on emotion and not within the confines of this challenge, I claim DNMC? Why? Because this is not singled out. This is a candid shot. <br/> <br/>To convince me of singled out needs at least one more subject weather a person or thing. Yes, your bg is blurred, but does not single out your main subject.<br/> <br/>comp nice, color good, light good, dof good, b&amp;w good, sharp, nice angle, good capture, overall a nice pix but not in this challenge.</td>', 'DNMC Unlike people that vote on emotion and not within the confines of this challenge, I claim DNMC? Why? Because this is not singled out. This is a candid shot.  To convince me of singled out needs at least one more subject weather a person or thing. Yes, your bg is blurred, but does not single out your main subject. comp nice, color good, light good, dof good, b&w good, sharp, nice angle, good capture, overall a nice pix but not in this challenge.', '2006-01-21 11:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
