(2068942, 279085, 30881, '<td valign="top">Was very impressed for the first while until I really studies the false screams. Well orchestrated image lol. Good job overall, just the right amount of lighting without added sunlight glare and some nice natural shadows of faces.</td>', 'Was very impressed for the first while until I really studies the false screams. Well orchestrated image lol. Good job overall, just the right amount of lighting without added sunlight glare and some nice natural shadows of faces.', '2006-01-21 20:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
