(2069346, 281870, 46468, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow DOF to isolate your subject, like that you actually focused on the back player instead of the typically choosen middle one.</td>', 'Great use of shallow DOF to isolate your subject, like that you actually focused on the back player instead of the typically choosen middle one.', '2006-01-21 22:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
