(2069939, 280683, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think that this would be much stronger if we could see her whole face.</td>', 'I think that this would be much stronger if we could see her whole face.', '2006-01-22 05:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069941, 279085, 29474, '<td valign="top">The contrast between his closed mouth and all the open-mouthed screams around him is wonderful.</td>', 'The contrast between his closed mouth and all the open-mouthed screams around him is wonderful.', '2006-01-22 05:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069943, 281901, 29474, '<td valign="top">The background is very distracting! But a slightly different and interesting take on the topic.</td>', 'The background is very distracting! But a slightly different and interesting take on the topic.', '2006-01-22 05:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069945, 280917, 29474, '<td valign="top">Did you have to paint them red? Another interesting PoV on the challenge topic.</td>', 'Did you have to paint them red? Another interesting PoV on the challenge topic.', '2006-01-22 05:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069947, 281500, 29474, '<td valign="top">I am sure there must be a crowd somewhere at the racetrack. I don''t see it. This is a good capture though. Did the price of beer start going down after he had drunk enough of those?</td>', 'I am sure there must be a crowd somewhere at the racetrack. I don''t see it. This is a good capture though. Did the price of beer start going down after he had drunk enough of those?', '2006-01-22 05:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069949, 280434, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is sooo powerful. ''Down here and alone amongst all these legs''. And she is well contrasted against all the emptiness in front of her. And the passers-by seem to be giving her a wide berth.<br/> <br/>I very rarely and pictures to me favourites ...</td>', 'This is sooo powerful. ''Down here and alone amongst all these legs''. And she is well contrasted against all the emptiness in front of her. And the passers-by seem to be giving her a wide berth. I very rarely and pictures to me favourites ...', '2006-01-22 05:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069959, 281805, 39116, '<td valign="top">well seen and taken ....suits the challenge title in all departments..well done !..i like it</td>', 'well seen and taken ....suits the challenge title in all departments..well done !..i like it', '2006-01-22 05:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069962, 280916, 39116, '<td valign="top">a well captured image ....and the blurred background has enhanced the picture...well done</td>', 'a well captured image ....and the blurred background has enhanced the picture...well done', '2006-01-22 05:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069964, 281817, 29474, '<td valign="top">A strong picture. I''m not sure that it fits the challenge without a lot of latitude being given.</td>', 'A strong picture. I''m not sure that it fits the challenge without a lot of latitude being given.', '2006-01-22 05:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069966, 281843, 39116, '<td valign="top">i like the one in focus and the other out of focus....makes it spot on for the challenge requirements...well seen and lovely picture</td>', 'i like the one in focus and the other out of focus....makes it spot on for the challenge requirements...well seen and lovely picture', '2006-01-22 05:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069967, 280288, 29474, '<td valign="top">Were you beat up? Nice isolation. Nice action shot. I think that I would crop most of the sky. It is very distracting.</td>', 'Were you beat up? Nice isolation. Nice action shot. I think that I would crop most of the sky. It is very distracting.', '2006-01-22 05:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069968, 281806, 39116, '<td valign="top">lovely picture ....well seen and taken..</td>', 'lovely picture ....well seen and taken..', '2006-01-22 05:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069970, 280404, 39116, '<td valign="top">great shot ...my favorite for top ten...</td>', 'great shot ...my favorite for top ten...', '2006-01-22 05:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069972, 281381, 39116, '<td valign="top">great shot ...well done...i love the lighting around the subjects face ....</td>', 'great shot ...well done...i love the lighting around the subjects face ....', '2006-01-22 05:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069974, 279654, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful portrait study. I presume there is a crowd somewhere ... I just don''t see it.</td>', 'This is a wonderful portrait study. I presume there is a crowd somewhere ... I just don''t see it.', '2006-01-22 05:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069985, 281272, 25355, '<td valign="top">Shame about the bottom crop, but this is what the Challenge called for, I think.</td>', 'Shame about the bottom crop, but this is what the Challenge called for, I think.', '2006-01-22 06:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069986, 279654, 25355, '<td valign="top">So you say, but there''s really no evidence of a crowd. Great portrait, anyway.</td>', 'So you say, but there''s really no evidence of a crowd. Great portrait, anyway.', '2006-01-22 06:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069990, 281734, 25355, '<td valign="top">Is this the one who had her wings stuck in the tree?? ;-)</td>', 'Is this the one who had her wings stuck in the tree?? ;-)', '2006-01-22 06:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069996, 280576, 25355, '<td valign="top">Even the title tells us he''s not in a crowd...</td>', 'Even the title tells us he''s not in a crowd...', '2006-01-22 06:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069997, 281921, 25355, '<td valign="top">Eh, obviously you drop your fear of candids for this Challenge...</td>', 'Eh, obviously you drop your fear of candids for this Challenge...', '2006-01-22 06:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070000, 281005, 25355, '<td valign="top">Crop off the cars on the left.</td>', 'Crop off the cars on the left.', '2006-01-22 06:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070122, 280404, 29474, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of a beautiful woman. Love the composition, the way the out of focus people lead into her, and how she looks into the empty part of the frame.</td>', 'Beautiful picture of a beautiful woman. Love the composition, the way the out of focus people lead into her, and how she looks into the empty part of the frame.', '2006-01-22 07:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070125, 280709, 29474, '<td valign="top">It terrible when you have to mark down a well compose and colourful picture because there is no crowd and no singling-out (single-outing?)</td>', 'It terrible when you have to mark down a well compose and colourful picture because there is no crowd and no singling-out (single-outing?)', '2006-01-22 07:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070126, 281921, 29474, '<td valign="top">A bit off the wall, but still does not make the challenge for me. It is interesting how the quality of the bills gets worse from front to back. Was that deliberate?</td>', 'A bit off the wall, but still does not make the challenge for me. It is interesting how the quality of the bills gets worse from front to back. Was that deliberate?', '2006-01-22 07:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070129, 280547, 29474, '<td valign="top">This really captures that occasional interlude in the mad rush of life. Well composed. Maybe that ''e'' above her left shoulder needs to be cloned out.</td>', 'This really captures that occasional interlude in the mad rush of life. Well composed. Maybe that ''e'' above her left shoulder needs to be cloned out.', '2006-01-22 07:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070131, 280709, 34192, '<td valign="top">I can see that the pillow is the center of an interesting composition but the table, being the whitest/brightest thing in the image, fights it for attention.  Good image but not sure of its placement in this challenge.</td>', 'I can see that the pillow is the center of an interesting composition but the table, being the whitest/brightest thing in the image, fights it for attention.  Good image but not sure of its placement in this challenge.', '2006-01-22 07:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070132, 281101, 34192, '<td valign="top">compositionally not very strong.  Not quite sure who is singled out.  The boy in the center?</td>', 'compositionally not very strong.  Not quite sure who is singled out.  The boy in the center?', '2006-01-22 07:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2070135, 281352, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love it when they glance at the camera and you manage to snap one before the moment goes away.  Composition a little awkward but the image is engaging.</td>', 'I love it when they glance at the camera and you manage to snap one before the moment goes away.  Composition a little awkward but the image is engaging.', '2006-01-22 07:43:23.000000', NULL, 1);
