(2072509, 280288, 17507, '<td valign="top">hahaha, great facial expression on this guy. the title really makes the picture.<br/> <br/>on the more technical side, i''d have liked to see more depth in the shadows. i don''t mind the grain. a composition that allowed us to see more of the traffic cop would have been really nice -</td>', 'hahaha, great facial expression on this guy. the title really makes the picture. on the more technical side, i''d have liked to see more depth in the shadows. i don''t mind the grain. a composition that allowed us to see more of the traffic cop would have been really nice -', '2006-01-22 22:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2072559, 281565, 19982, '<td valign="top">I really like this one - hope to see it near the top.  The girls in the background, in spite of being outside the field of focus, really add emphasis to the foreground girl.  The lighting, the leading lines in the walls and the camera angle also work well to bring you right to the subject.  Could it ribbon?  I''m hoping it will.  :-)</td>', 'I really like this one - hope to see it near the top.  The girls in the background, in spite of being outside the field of focus, really add emphasis to the foreground girl.  The lighting, the leading lines in the walls and the camera angle also work well to bring you right to the subject.  Could it ribbon?  I''m hoping it will.  :-)', '2006-01-22 22:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2072563, 281266, 19066, '<td valign="top">Oh, the horror!  Nice capture.</td>', 'Oh, the horror!  Nice capture.', '2006-01-22 22:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2072640, 281537, 1031, '<td valign="top">Those look like brachiosaurs ... nice contrast between the bright colors fore- and background and the skin-tones of the child.</td>', 'Those look like brachiosaurs ... nice contrast between the bright colors fore- and background and the skin-tones of the child.', '2006-01-22 23:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2072648, 281843, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good use of light in addition to DOF to emphasize your subject.</td>', 'Good use of light in addition to DOF to emphasize your subject.', '2006-01-22 23:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2072652, 280725, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. I gave it a 7. I would have given it a higher score but I felt that having him in the foreground so separate from everyone else didn''t fulfill the challenge very well.</td>', 'Great portrait. I gave it a 7. I would have given it a higher score but I felt that having him in the foreground so separate from everyone else didn''t fulfill the challenge very well.', '2006-01-22 23:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2072664, 281593, 1031, '<td valign="top">Wish the subject''s face was a little lighter, but I suspect it''s actually my monitor''s problem.</td>', 'Wish the subject''s face was a little lighter, but I suspect it''s actually my monitor''s problem.', '2006-01-22 23:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
