(2072739, 279319, 27133, '<td valign="top">You are probably getting voted right down because of "the lack of crowd" and, as they put it "lack of DOF''.  Don''t worry...you are not alone.  I, too, am getting the same comments.  <br/> <br/>But I think a photo should be judged 1 - on meeting the challenge and 2 - on the quality of the photograph.<br/> <br/>So I am giving you a 9 as this is a beautiful photo.</td>', 'You are probably getting voted right down because of "the lack of crowd" and, as they put it "lack of DOF''.  Don''t worry...you are not alone.  I, too, am getting the same comments.   But I think a photo should be judged 1 - on meeting the challenge and 2 - on the quality of the photograph. So I am giving you a 9 as this is a beautiful photo.', '2006-01-22 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2072741, 281266, 29009, '<td valign="top">Oh, this one made me laugh.  A shame about the blown out sky, but this has lots of visual interest.  Nice perspective.</td>', 'Oh, this one made me laugh.  A shame about the blown out sky, but this has lots of visual interest.  Nice perspective.', '2006-01-22 23:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
