(2073607, 281729, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice work Charmayne. It''s funny in your comments you state that you had better candids but this one best met the Challenge. My thoughts exactly, when I entered my image...but the rules didn''t seem to matter much in this one. 1st place while and awesome image didn''t have any signs of a minimal dof. I took things kinda litterally and could have placed higher with a simple, cool, shallow candid. "...in the crowd" and the shallow dof was my standard which had to be met.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-23 10:49:17.</i></td>', 'Nice work Charmayne. It''s funny in your comments you state that you had better candids but this one best met the Challenge. My thoughts exactly, when I entered my image...but the rules didn''t seem to matter much in this one. 1st place while and awesome image didn''t have any signs of a minimal dof. I took things kinda litterally and could have placed higher with a simple, cool, shallow candid. "...in the crowd" and the shallow dof was my standard which had to be met.', '2006-01-23 07:29:37.000000', '2006-01-23 10:49:17.000000', 0),
