(2073848, 280404, 14603, '<td valign="top">After two years of submitting and voting on challenges, I have found it increasingly difficult to get excited by an image (my own included)as the senses seem to dull with the repetition.<br/>However, every now and then a picture crops up which stirs things back into life.<br/>This one does it for me.<br/>I love everything about it..it`s fresh and vibrant and suits the toning effect very well.<br/>My favourite from the challenge.<br/> <br/>Congratulations.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-23 09:48:29.</i></td>', 'After two years of submitting and voting on challenges, I have found it increasingly difficult to get excited by an image (my own included)as the senses seem to dull with the repetition.However, every now and then a picture crops up which stirs things back into life.This one does it for me.I love everything about it..it`s fresh and vibrant and suits the toning effect very well.My favourite from the challenge. Congratulations.', '2006-01-23 09:42:27.000000', '2006-01-23 09:48:29.000000', 0),
