(2077971, 280434, 17850, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments and votes. <br/>It is good to see this photo so high rated. On the other hand it is not good at all to see people like this old woman. <br/>I know that it is almost impossible to help all the lonely and homeless humans. But at least I will never ignore them when passing nearby.<br/>As photography has the power to make us more sensitive, I hope to use this power effectively in my life.<br/></td>', 'Thank you for all the comments and votes. It is good to see this photo so high rated. On the other hand it is not good at all to see people like this old woman. I know that it is almost impossible to help all the lonely and homeless humans. But at least I will never ignore them when passing nearby.As photography has the power to make us more sensitive, I hope to use this power effectively in my life.', '2006-01-24 12:46:35.000000', NULL, 0),
